SUMMARY
Minimal guidance, complex pivoting requirements, and a messy intrusion that mirrors real-world incident complexity. Completing this demonstrates the IR can handle novel, unstructured breaches independently — the gold standard for IR certification.

LEARNING OBJECTIVES
- Use multiple data sets to answer targeted questions
- Investigate cyber activity in logs
- Use multiple techniques to track the activity of APTs (Advanced Persistent Threats)
- Use third-party data sets to discover insights about your attackers
- Make recommendations on actions a company can take to protect itself

SOURCE
https://kc7cyber.com/challenges/104

STEPS TAKEN
Section 0: KQL 101
How many employees are in the company?
Employees
| count
Answer: 1500

Each employee at Spooky Sweets Candy Company is assigned an IP address. Which employee has the IP address: “10.10.0.251”?
Employees
| where ip_addr == "10.10.0.251"
